      "message": "Disabling PUEN doesn\u0027t put the high side into hi-z; it actually connects the two CC pins together with 20.4k resistance.  This isn\u0027t enough to be considered \"open\" from the type-c spec, and is really here just to save power when DEVICE_ODL is asserted low.\n\nSo Ryu should be treated the same as Samus in that it cannot truly go hi-z.",
